    /* Win option bp[0]: INDEX result may stamp i32 (esz=4) while base is *u8.
     * Prefer base *T peel whenever it is strictly smaller (not only esz>=8).
     * PLATFORM: WINDOWS leftover-PE / SHARED INDEX esz. */
